<h2 class="toptitle">Emergency Contacts</h2>










<p><p>In case of an emergency involving an American citizen, please call the 24-hour operator at the U.S. Embassy or the nearest U.S. Consulate General using the numbers below and ask for American Citizen Services. If you are calling from the United States, first dial<strong> 011-91- </strong></p>
<ul>
<li>New Delhi: <a href="tel:(0)11-2419-8000">(0)11-2419-8000</a></li>
<li>Chennai: (<a href="tel:0)44-2857-4000">0)44-2857-4000</a></li>
<li>Hyderabad: <a href="https://in.usembassy.gov/hyderabad/"><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">(0)40-6932-8000</span></a></li>
<li>Kolkata: <a href="tel:(0)33-3984-2400">(0)<span data-teams="true">33-6827-2400</span></a></li>
<li>Mumbai: <a href="tel:(0)22-2672-4000">(0)22-2672-4000</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Other emergency numbers:</p>
<ul>
<li>Contact the police by calling <a href="tel:112"><strong>112</strong></a> (even if you dial 100 your call will be diverted to 112)</li>
<li>Contact the Fire brigade by calling <a href="tel:101"><strong>101</strong></a></li>
<li>Contact an Ambulance by calling <a href="tel:108"><strong>108</strong></a> or <strong><a href="tel:102">102</a></strong></li>
<li>Contact helpline number for women grievances <a href="tel:1090"><strong>1090</strong></a></li>
</ul>
</p>








